+    2005-04-03  Behdad Esfahbod:  Initial revision.
+    2005-10-09  Behdad Esfahbod:  Turned off back-slant and Tahoma sections.
+    2005-11-30  Behdad Esfahbod:  Set Titr susbtitution size to 24 points.
